# MagmaFlow

**An Interactive Volcano Plot Application for Differential Gene Expression Analysis**

![MagmaFlow Interface](MagmaFlow_Panel%20(6).png)

## Overview

MagmaFlow is a powerful, user-friendly JavaFX application designed for creating interactive volcano plots from differential gene expression data. It provides researchers with an intuitive interface to visualize statistical significance versus fold change patterns in genomic datasets.

## Key Features

### Advanced Color Schemes
- **Gurzov Classic Style**: Traditional blue/red coloring for down/up-regulated genes
- **MagmaFlow Classic Styles**: Customizable gradient palettes with direct color refinement
  - Classic 1: P-value based gradients
  - Classic 2: Log2 fold change based gradients  
  - Classic 3: Combined p-value and fold change gradients
- **MagmaFlow Viridis & Magma Styles**: Professional scientific color palettes
- **Custom Color Pickers**: Direct access to RGB/Hex color refinement without palette selection

### Interactive Visualization
- **Double-click Gene Selection**: Add or remove target genes by double-clicking data points
- **Drag & Drop Labels**: Reposition gene annotations by dragging
- **Flexible Edge Connections**: Choose how annotation lines connect to labels (left, right, center, smart, auto)
- **Zoom & Pan Controls**: SHIFT+drag panning, mouse wheel zooming, fit-to-viewport
- **Hover Information**: Real-time gene details on mouse hover

### Target Gene Management
- Load target gene lists from files
- Manual gene entry via text input
- Checkbox-based gene visibility control
- Smart annotation positioning to prevent overlap
- Configurable edge connection styles for cleaner plots

### Comprehensive Customization
- **Independent Font Controls**: Separate font sizes for title, axis labels, tick labels, and gene annotations
- **Flexible Thresholds**: Adjustable p-value and log2 fold change cutoffs
- **Tick Spacing**: Manual or automatic axis tick intervals
- **Dot Styling**: Opacity control, outline options, size adjustment
- **Export Options**: High-resolution PNG and PDF export with DPI control

### Project Management
- **Save/Load Projects**: Preserve all settings, annotations, and customizations
- **Auto-save Indicators**: Track unsaved changes with visual feedback
- **CSV Import**: Flexible column mapping for various data formats

## Installation & Usage

### Prerequisites
- Java 17 or higher
- JavaFX runtime (included in most distributions)

### Quick Start
1. Clone the repository:
```bash
   git clone https://github.com/carlosbuss1/MagmaFlow.git
   cd MagmaFlow
